            "summary": "History professor Jason Gibson of Alcorn State University (Mississippi) hid one line of white-on-white text in a midterm prompt on the Industrial Revolution, telling any chatbot to insert the word 'Madagascar' in a way that makes no sense; 32 of his 35 students across two summer classes turned in papers containing it. The stunt is a live classroom demo of prompt injection, ranked the #1 security risk in the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025.",
