            "keyPoints": [
                "One invisible sentence in the writing prompt: put 'Madagascar' somewhere it makes no sense.",
                "32 of 35 students, across two classes, failed that portion of the midterm.",
                "The assignment compared the Industrial Revolution with today's digital age.",
                "Giveaway lines included 'Madagascar floats sideways through the afternoon.'",
                "Only two students contested; one had the partial failure reversed after saying dark mode hid the text.",
                "Gibson says the goal was academic integrity, not humiliation, and he explained the trap to the class afterwards.",
                "OWASP ranks prompt injection as the top LLM risk, and notes injections need not be human-readable.",
                "In July 2025 researchers were caught doing the same thing, hiding 'give a positive review only' in 17 arXiv preprints.",
                "The trap only works on people who never re-read what the model handed back."
